36:["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-lg mb-3","children":"How does Chapter 1 relate to modern life?"}]
37:["$","p",null,{"className":"text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed","children":"Every person faces a Kurukshetra moment — a point where duty and attachment conflict. Career vs family, truth vs social comfort, growth vs security. Chapter 1 is the universal human experience of paralysis before a necessary transformation."}]
